                "npc_name": "§aZio Beppe",
                "text": "§0My creatures are the best!\nEvery egg is a new life.\nTreat my animals well.\n§cIf you have an automatic egg farm... you absolute animal.\n\n§e§lBUY §0(you give gems)\n§0Wolf §c-75\n§0Horse §c-100\n§0Donkey §c-70\n§0Rabbit §c-45\n§0Bee §c-70\n§0Axolotl §c-90\n§0Panda §c-135\n§0Fox §c-75\n§0Ocelot §c-60\n§0Cat §c-60\n§0Parrot §c-62\n§0Frog §c-55\n§0Goat §c-62\n§0Llama §c-85\n§0Turtle §c-75\n§0Polar Bear §c-75\n§0Camel §c-125\n§0Armadillo §c-70\n§0Strider §c-62\n§0Mooshroom §c-105\n§0Hoglin §c-70\n§0Enderman §c-85\n§0Phantom §c-100\n§0Sniffer §c-150\n§0Allay §c-120\n§0Breeze §c-200\n§4Warden §c-400\n§0Tadpole §c-40\n§0Glow Squid §c-50\n§0Iron Golem §c-160\n\n§a§lSELL §0(the NPC pays you)\n§0Egg x512 §a+1\n§0Feather x512 §a+1\n§0Wool x512 §a+1\n§0Leather x256 §a+1\n§0Rabbit Hide x384 §a+1\n§0Armadillo Scute x64 §a+1",
